        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following customer quotation request email.\n\nExtract the information and return ONLY valid JSON with this structure:\n\n{\n  \"company\": null,\n  \"service\": null,\n  \"location\": null,\n  \"number_of_sites\": null,\n  \"deadline\": null,\n  \"budget\": null,\n  \"site_size\": null,\n  \"summary\": null,\n  \"missing_information\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n- Do not invent information.\n- If a value is missing, return null.\n- number_of_sites must be a number or null.\n- missing_information must be an array of short strings.\n- Ignore signatures, tracking links, HTML, disclaimers and unrelated email content.\n- Return JSON only, without markdown or explanations.\n\nCustomer email:\n\n{{$json.raw_email}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
